CM 40 m quarter-wave vertical with four elevated drooping radials
CM Feedpoint 6 m above average real ground (Sommerfeld/Norton)
CM Radials run 9.5 m out and drop 4 m (about 23 degrees), which raises the
CM feed resistance to about 50 ohms; SWR under 1.7 across 7.0-7.3 MHz
CE
SY base_h=6, vert_len=10.3
SY rad_run=9.5, rad_drop=4
SY rad_end=base_h-rad_drop, top=base_h+vert_len
SY rad=0.001
GW 1 21 0 0 base_h 0 0 top rad
GW 2 21 0 0 base_h rad_run 0 rad_end rad
GW 3 21 0 0 base_h 0 rad_run rad_end rad
GW 4 21 0 0 base_h -rad_run 0 rad_end rad
GW 5 21 0 0 base_h 0 -rad_run rad_end rad
GE 1
GN 2 0 0 0 13 0.005
EX 0 1 1 0 1 0
FR 0 31 0 0 7.0 0.01
RP 0 19 73 1000 0 0 5 5
EN
